Package: DynamicDOOR
Type: Package
Title: Estimation and Inference for Longitudinal Ordinal Win Probabilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Anonymous", "Authors", email = "anonymous@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates visit-specific and weighted-average win probabilities
    for repeated ordinal outcomes using augmented inverse probability weighting
    and targeted maximum likelihood estimation, with optional cross-fitting,
    pooled targeting, and corrections for nuisance estimation.
